/target
**/*.bak
**/.phronesis/log.jsonl
**/.phronesis/log.jsonl.1
**/.phronesis/rules.json.bak
**/.phronesis/journey/
**/.phronesis/graph.jsonl
**/.phronesis/graph.index

# Local agent worktrees
.worktrees/

# Private cross-project docs — keep local, never publish
docs/specs/*-migration-map.md
docs/specs/PLAN-v0.11-hardening.md

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Local IDE / agent configs (not part of the project)
.claude/
.crush/
.gemini/
.qwen/
.obsidian/
.vscode/
.mcp.json

# Local agent state — the whole root directory is local-only. Reviewed
# policy travels in config/phronesis/ (provisioned with `phr-mcp provision`)
# and canonical ADRs live in docs/decisions/.
/.phronesis/

# Point-in-time project evaluations. Generated from local audit/graph/stats
# state, so they go stale the moment the tree moves — keep them local rather
# than versioning a snapshot that will disagree with the repo it describes.
docs/phronesis-evaluation-*.html

# Coverage evidence derived state (SPEC-coverage-evidence)
*.profraw
crates/phronesis-mcp/tests/fixtures/coverage-sample/target/

# Website build output and caches
docs/_site/
docs/.jekyll-cache/

# Python documentation-checker bytecode
**/__pycache__/

# Local agent skill files: ignore by default so unrelated local skills are
# never imported into Git; the shipped docs-maintenance skill is the explicit
# allowlist exception.
.agents/**
!.agents/skills/
!.agents/skills/maintain-phronesis-docs/
!.agents/skills/maintain-phronesis-docs/SKILL.md
!.agents/skills/maintain-phronesis-docs/templates/
!.agents/skills/maintain-phronesis-docs/templates/spec-status-header.md
